      "date": "2026-05-25T12:06:55.000Z",
      "title": "Now 32% overvalued after recent price rise",
      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has risen 45% to ₹706. The fair value is estimated to be ₹533, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 16% over the last 3 years. Earnings per share has grown by 30%. Revenue is forecast to grow by 22% in 2 years. Earnings are forecast to grow by 41% in the next 2 years.",
